== Effects ==
* Upon [[death]], respawns Isaac as {{c|Black Judas}} with two {{e|Black Heart}}s in the previous room.

== Notes ==
* Resurrection items activate in a [[:Category:Revival items|set order]]. 
** {{dlc+|nr}} Judas' Shadow is 8th in this order after {{i|1up!}}, {{i|Dead Cat}}, {{c|Lazarus}}' inherent extra life, {{i|Guppy's Collar}}, {{i|Lazarus' Rags}}, {{i|Ankh}}, and {{t|Broken Ankh}}. {{dlc-}}
** {{dlc+|r}} Judas' Shadow is 10th in this order after {{p|Soul of Lazarus}}, {{i|1up!}}, {{c|Lazarus}}' inherent extra life, {{i|Dead Cat}}, {{i|Inner Child}}, {{i|Guppy's Collar}}, {{i|Lazarus' Rags}}, {{i|Ankh}}, and {{t|Broken Ankh}}. {{dlc-}}
* Beating bosses as {{c|Black Judas}} will give [[Completion Mark]]s for {{c|Judas}} and will unlock the associated items and achievements.

== Synergies ==
* {{c|Tainted Judas}}: Revived as Tainted Judas instead of Black Judas.

